WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.558 --> 00:00:05.699
What if your team of AI agents never did anything important without asking you first?

2
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:15.552
This is Guildwise HQ. You describe the work as a card. Out of the box, agents specify it, build it, review it and test it, on your own machines.

3
00:00:16.251 --> 00:00:21.776
When an agent needs a decision, it asks you on your desk. You answer once, and the team carries on.

4
00:00:24.465 --> 00:00:29.713
Start with a rough idea, and an analyst turns it into a requirements document you approve.

5
00:00:31.339 --> 00:00:35.371
Your code stays on your workstations. The server never holds your keys.

6
00:00:38.506 --> 00:00:42.047
Free and open source. Run it yourself, or let us host it.
